sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant MutWH as Mutating Webhook<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS
    participant ValWH as Validating Webhook<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS
    participant RCC as RayClusterReconciler
    participant AuthCtrl as AuthenticationController
    participant MTLSCtrl as mTLS Controller
    participant CertMgr as cert-manager
    participant Gateway as Platform Gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant RBACProxy as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant RayHead as Ray Head<br/>8265/TCP HTTP
    participant RayWorker as Ray Worker<br/>10001/TCP gRPC

    Note over User,RayWorker: Flow 1: RayCluster Creation with Authentication

    User->>K8sAPI: POST RayCluster CR<br/>Bearer Token (OAuth)
    K8sAPI->>MutWH: Admission Review<br/>TLS (cert-manager)
    MutWH-->>K8sAPI: Set enableSecureTrustedNetwork=true<br/>Set enableIngress=false
    K8sAPI->>ValWH: Admission Review<br/>TLS (cert-manager)
    ValWH-->>K8sAPI: Validated

    K8sAPI-->>RCC: Watch event
    RCC->>K8sAPI: Create Pods, Services, RBAC<br/>ServiceAccount Token
    K8sAPI-->>AuthCtrl: Watch event
    AuthCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create ServiceAccount, HTTPRoute<br/>ReferenceGrant
    K8sAPI-->>MTLSCtrl: Watch event
    MTLSCtrl->>CertMgr: Create Issuer + Certificates
    CertMgr-->>K8sAPI: TLS Secrets (head, worker, CA)

    Note over User,RayWorker: Flow 2: Authenticated Dashboard Access

    User->>Gateway: GET /ray-dashboard<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    Gateway->>RBACProxy: Forward<br/>OAuth/OIDC
    RBACProxy->>RayHead: GET /dashboard<br/>HTTP (localhost)
    RayHead-->>RBACProxy: Dashboard Response
    RBACProxy-->>Gateway: Response
    Gateway-->>User: Dashboard HTML

    Note over User,RayWorker: Flow 3: Ray Inter-Node mTLS

    RayHead->>RayWorker: gRPC 10001/TCP<br/>mTLS (cert-manager CA)
    RayWorker-->>RayHead: Task Results<br/>mTLS
